{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_024_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:82cdf61b8e2bf68657cd5822477fdeca568559c2d6d6db12975f4ea1b1f4c0b7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_d:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78b2075ea7fcb7e80e823e34810cc079fa038cbedfd5a29fe03c134c5b18549e",
      "text": "活动开始",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:239d5087efc27109bad5082aba7d66b4ea86796eeea64b18c1a02191890384ef",
      "text": "大家好——！气氛嗨起来了吗——！\n容我再次自我介绍，我是High×Joker的伊濑谷四季！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81741276cdc5684bfc5d1a66813012d79f87a4f30e077a96f0589f80b624ed3b",
      "text": "我以前也来过这个活动哦！\n所以能被邀请，超级超级开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e06d937da20c46b5dbeb49a7ee49a90a488d23e8e5d5edf5d2323c3435c2796f",
      "text": "虽然今天只有我一个人，但平时我和超绝Mega\n厉害的前辈们5个人一起活动！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0bc74cac57f81805b192e13effdfb4918d8f1523dd2134ded4bfa9abde48f28",
      "text": "知道High×Joker的人！\n请举手——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86323d2e29e02276325f861da1b964300c2cc561796fe25af65bbaa7fe44b07f",
      "text": "喔～！？有这么多人知道我们……！\n好开心！Thank you啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2296ac497bf9f02a73ebe1fa1d02a7af474d1bb759e4d567109fadedc5cd3eb1",
      "text": "（四季先生的谈吐真是状态绝佳呢。\n台下的气氛也超级热烈）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_d:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63d00df2bf6b25e209ef40adf118d39ad27d06782b8071a170e22987089ea9cd",
      "text": "（而且……四季先生的祖母看起来\n也很开心。真是太好了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_d:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2bb3dc22df49eb9d9e006c6cb6345f2667dc6f9989a767a1f98706c1cc8b9f8",
      "text": "……总而言之，我们最近要出新歌的CD，\n大家可以去听听看哦……话虽如此！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_d:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddef774fc03868d95d2074d2dd5b2157afa6d3c54defa8d300e6653504475485",
      "text": "虽说想一直这么聊下去，\n不过时间好像差不多到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_d:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96e72f1ec261e7564be912c3fdcf42cf1ef13185ede935aa8ae9e726aa857576",
      "text": "最后就用这首歌向大家道别吧！\n那么，要上咯！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
